ely  lightweight minimal equipment you can do  it in your living room or in a garden  that's covered in cat poo there's really  no reason you can't train your legs and  if you have any difficulties with  mobility etc all these exercises can be  adjusted a squat can be performed with  your arms on a chair for example or you  can even lift yourself up have a spot to  help you we can use squat blocks if you  lack range of motion or weight lifting  shoes there's plenty of options and no  excuse for skipping leg day  with just these exercises you can build  a full routine adapt it to your own  level do it from anywhere and hopefully  that's enough to get you started but  there's plenty more i could have  included and again these are movements  that are adaptable can be done from  anywhere you can do farmers walks in  your garden just doing laps of the  garden holding weights you can do it on  one side if you want to strengthen the  quadratus lumborum if you want to build  that oblique strength we can do on both  sides if you just want pure trap  strength and you want to focus on hip  stability and walking you can do single  leg jump squats if you have the balance  and stability this is very cool because  you normally explode off of one leg not  two in most situations you can do  skipping to build more car strength and  ankle stiffness which translates to  faster sprint times you know the hindu  squats are among my favorites a slightly  gentler way for training than these  [ __ ] squats take that a bit further but  i also actually really rate them as long  as you ease into them really nice and  carefully nordic curls bit difficult to  set up absolutely insane for your  hamstring development and of course the  kettlebell swing itself which translates  to better jump height running speed  people talk about the what the hell  effects just because it does so much  good stuff i'm gonna make a whole video  on that in future so i haven't gone into  it in depth here let me know your  favorite leg exercises in the comments  down below and how you train your legs  from home and stay tuned for more like  this hope you found this video useful  interesting guys if you did then please  leave a like and share around if you  like this kind of training that looks  not just at your appearance and your  physique but also your performance the  way you move mobility strength endurance  even brain function then you'll enjoy my  ebook and training program super  functional training and like this  workout all of that is designed to be  done from home with minimal equipment  there's even a minimal equipment version  of the routine included in the package  so check that out let me know your  favorite leg exercises in the comments  down below and how you train your legs  from home please subscribe and hit the  bell button if you want to be notified  of future uploads that's actually one of  the very best things you can do to  support the channel so massively  appreciated but as always i appreciate  you just for watching thank you so much  see you next time  bye for now
 

